{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n '\"'^##|''^###|D676|D725|D741|D745'\"' AGENTS.md docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/{SMALL-DESIGN,PAID-GATE}.md\"","aggregated_output":"AGENTS.md:9:## Where to look first\nAGENTS.md:27:## Authority and scope\nAGENTS.md:59:## 1. Before acting on a failure: diagnose\nAGENTS.md:91:## 2. Before writing code: design\nAGENTS.md:122:## 3. Writing code\nAGENTS.md:145:## 4. Tests\nAGENTS.md:168:## 5. Verification\nAGENTS.md:194:## 6. Writing prompts\nAGENTS.md:237:## 7. Measuring and iterating\nAGENTS.md:239:### 7.1 The ruler\nAGENTS.md:292:### 7.2 Reading results\nAGENTS.md:326:### 7.3 Iterating\nAGENTS.md:388:## 8. Product thinking\nAGENTS.md:419:## 9. Workspace and operations\nAGENTS.md:449:## 10. Rebuilding from ../tn-hivemind\nAGENTS.md:456:## 11. Design documents and decisions\nAGENTS.md:485:## Before finishing a slice\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:16:- D725's pass lines and D731's harness rules;\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:19:## 1. What is dropped, and where it goes\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:32:## 2. The rules code enforces (revised after round 52, `codex-r52.md`; the revision is marked [52])\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:59:## 2-old. The rules as first written (superseded by the revision above)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:78:## 3. The wire schema, word for word (examples from no covered company, AGENTS §6)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:143:## 4. Build\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:162:## 5. The $0 blind test (registered; REPAIR-DESIGN.md §5 with rounds 51's fixes)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:277:D725's lines. Only that run measures whether luna can do it.\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:350:**[D745] The targeted test (Alex: \"批准针对性小测\"; a justified unresolved answer counts as usable, \"算合格\"; council rounds 59–60), registered\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/PAID-GATE.md:1:# judging-v13 paid gate: plan, harness and reading rule (registered before any send; D725, D729, D730)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/PAID-GATE.md:5:## 1. What is sent\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/PAID-GATE.md:27:## 2. Spend and stops\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/PAID-GATE.md:42:## 3. The $0 rehearsal (`paid_rehearsal.py`, `rehearsal.log`: 16 of 16)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/PAID-GATE.md:56:## 3b. After council round 47 (`codex-r47.md`)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/PAID-GATE.md:80:## 3c. After council round 47b (`codex-r47b.md`)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/PAID-GATE.md:118:## 3d. After council round 47c (`codex-r47c.md`)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/PAID-GATE.md:159:## 3e. After council round 47d (`codex-r47d.md`): three structural rules\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/PAID-GATE.md:189:## 3f. After council round 47e (`codex-r47e.md`)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/PAID-GATE.md:195:  - D725 registered both arms \"under the same format and checks\" and says nothing about retries. Its pass and stop lines stay as\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/PAID-GATE.md:216:## 3g. After council round 47f (`codex-r47f.md`)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/PAID-GATE.md:236:## 3h. After council round 47g (`codex-r47g.md`)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/PAID-GATE.md:252:## 4. The reading rule (fixed now, before any answer exists)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/PAID-GATE.md:270:- **Verdict** (`paid_gate.py verdict`, D725's lines, on the first attempts; computed once and sealed, §3f):\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/PAID-GATE.md:278:## 5. What the result decides\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
